# The package is authored with LF endings and the Python scripts are meant to be
# byte-identical everywhere, so normalise on commit and check out LF on every
# platform. Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true rewrites every
# .py and .md file on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never touched (the package ships none today, but generated
# decks and element PNGs land in the working tree during use).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
